      "lines": [
        "43．单项式的概念"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式 $5a^2x^3$、$2b^3\\cdot3by^2$、$-3a^7$、$\\frac{1}{2}c^4(-7c^2)$ 是数字、变量、变量",
        "的幂的乘积．这样的式子叫做单项式．",
        "数字、变量和变量的幂，也叫做单项式．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "单项式 $2b^3\\cdot3by^2$ 可以写成各种不同的形式，例如写成",
        "$6bbbbyy$ 或者 $6b^4y^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在变量 $b$ 与 $y$ 的值构成的所有数对集合上，单项式",
        "$6bbbbyy$ 和 $6b^4y^2$ 都恒等于单项式 $6b^4y^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们以后把在所有数（数对、三个数等等）的集合上恒等",
        "的式子，简称为“这些式子恒等”．类似地，把在所有数（数对、",
        "三个数等等）的集合上的恒等式，简称为“给出的等式是恒等",
        "式”．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "单项式 $6b^4y^2$ 和单项式 $2b^3\\cdot3by^2$、$6bbbbyy$ 的区别是：它",
        "只在最前面有一个数字因数，并且相同变量的积都写成了幂．",
        "单项式的这种形式叫做标准形式．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "标准形式的单项式的数字因数叫做单项式的系数．例如",
        "单项式 $-5a^4b^7$ 的系数等于 $-5$，单项式 $\\frac{3}{7}x$ 的系数等于 $\\frac{3}{7}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为 $a^2x=1\\cdot a^2x$，$-bc=-1\\cdot bc$，所以这种单项式的系数分别",
        "是 $1$ 与 $-1$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "745",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "745．求单项式的值：",
        "а）$5x^3$，当 $x=0.5$ 时；　б）$-0.125y^4$，当 $y=-2$ 时．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "746",
